  "term": "Luvox",
  "definition": "Luvox is fluvoxamine maleate, a drug with antidepressant and anti-obsessive-compulsive effects that has also been described as having antibulimic activity. It works by blocking serotonin reuptake, which raises serotonin levels between nerve cells and strengthens serotonin signaling.",
